0175\"],\"reason\":\"완료 산출물과 최종 전달은 관찰됐지만, 산출물에 필수 평가 기준과 가격 제외 조건이 반영되지 않아 유효한 ProposalRepeat@v1 최종 전달 endpoint를 충족하지 않는다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":null,\"valid_publication_id\":null},\"reactions\":[{\"evidence\":[\"E5468\",\"E5477\",\"P:1:182681b5-63ad-40aa-bca8-54a26ca68fd0\"],\"first_actual_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 작업이 접수(ACCEPTED)되었습니다.\",\"first_actual_publication_id\":\"P:1:182681b5-63ad-40aa-bca8-54a26ca68fd0\",\"id\":\"I-S2-04-1\",\"reason\":\"현재 요청의 첫 핵심 응답은 실제 Agent 접수 이후의 접수 안내이며 반응 endpoint에 해당한다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"CREATE_PROPOSAL 작업이 접수(ACCEPTED)되었습니다.\",\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:1:182681b5-63ad-40aa-bca8-54a26ca68fd0\",\"wrong_first\":false}],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0d82a44998a47bef016acc365403b887d095aedc30469a2d69","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"high","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","status":"completed","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_object"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":19523,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":914,"cached_tokens":18606},"output_tokens":2293,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1403},"total_tokens":21816},"user":null}
